00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:30.564 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Mgr GÉRALD CYPRIEN-LACROIX,

00:00:28.428 --> 00:00:31.798 size:53% position:73% line:53%
archevêque de Québec

00:00:29.663 --> 00:00:32.999 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Il souhaitait, si les chos

00:00:30.897 --> 00:00:34.234 size:53% position:73% line:53%
s'adonnent, de venir autour

00:00:32.132 --> 00:00:35.435 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de la fête de Sainte-Anne. Ah!

00:00:33.333 --> 00:00:36.670 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ça, ça nous situe dans le temps.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.904 size:53% position:73% line:53%
La fête de Sainte-Anne,

00:00:35.769 --> 00:00:39.139 size:53% position:73% line:53%
c'est le 26 juillet. Alors

00:00:37.003 --> 00:00:40.340 size:53% position:73% line:53%
